# Gorilla 157 privacy cut
# Build 28 privacy batch, Gorilla agreed 2026-10-07. D-157-14: Early Hints preconnect and page preconnect locked off (a 103 reply had its own 10-connection allowance past speculative-parallel-limit 0). D-157-21: extensions.ml.enabled and new-tab personalised sections locked off. Dead AI menu entries removed (app menu: New AI Window with BETA badge, New Classic Window, Chats; File menu: New AI / Classic Window) with the badge CSS rule; the AI .ftl files stay because 54 of their strings are still used by shipping code.
# Files: browser/app/profile/firefox.js, browser/base/content/appmenu-viewcache.inc.xhtml, browser/base/content/browser-menubar.inc.xhtml, browser/themes/shared/browser-shared.css

diff --git a/browser/app/profile/firefox.js b/browser/app/profile/firefox.js
index 392789c5b2..f57c955b0e 100644
